<title>USA: US bank borrowings average $542 mln/day Oct 2 week.</title>
<headline>US bank borrowings average $542 mln/day Oct 2 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said U.S. bank discount window borrowings, less extended credits, averaged $542 million per day in the week ended October 2.</p>
<p>Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
